  "note": "T-092 materials round 2 (presets/3). Self-contained: the defaults below are this file's own, so later edits to presets.json (presets/1) or skin_presets.json (presets/2) never change a presets/3 preset, and no presets/1 or presets/2 id is redefined here. A spec opts in only by naming one of these ids in materials.assignments.<slot>.preset or a garment material entry; every spec that names a presets/1 or presets/2 id builds exactly as before. Fabric targets: B08 hoodie fleece, B09 trousers, G07 vest felt, G08 shorts and boot cuffs, the boy's 01 closeup sheet and the girl's ref_42 material sheet. Every fibrous preset carries one uniform fibre halo (low colour and lean variation, root/tip fade) through the shared Geometry Nodes group PS Shared Surface Fibres/1; clump (nap) and albedo breakup are kept low so the fabrics read dense and even, not mottled or speckled.",
